# Operettensaenger: the singing head waiter of the Weisses Roessl operetta.
# Black tailcoat d/m, white shirt front w, small wine bow tie R, slicked
# dark hair l with an O shine, grey trousers m/d, white napkin w/i over the
# forearm. No hat, no instrument, no green Tracht (not a Blasmusiker).
# Faces right; mirror = auto. Drafted with a scratch script (interior art +
# automatic k outline), then frozen to text here.
sprite = operettensaenger
size   = 16x24
origin = 8,24
hitbox = 2,2,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = idle     frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = inhale   frames=1
anim   = sing     frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = squished frames=1
